# The vectors a reader fails when this rule is deleted, and no others:
# an end refuses a whole byte after the object.
#
# CMakeLists.txt builds that reader, and ctest requires its failures to be
# exactly this list. A vector added to the corpus that pins the rule belongs here.

end-refuse-one-zero-byte-after-the-empty-object
end-refuse-one-set-byte-after-the-empty-object
end-refuse-zero-byte-after-an-unaligned-object
end-refuse-zero-byte-after-an-aligned-object
end-refuse-a-byte-after-bytes
end-refuse-trailing-data-before-padding
